context:
DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/tokens/{token_id}
Destroy an Account Owned API token.
Required: account_id (path); token_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/tokens/{token_id}
Get information about a specific Account Owned API token.
Required: account_id (path); token_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/tokens/{token_id}
Update an existing token.
Required: account_id (path); token_id (path); body (body)
